cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "WW3 GPU Lab: agentic coding and agentic research on a bit-for-bit GPU port of WAVEWATCH III"
abstract: >-
  Software and texts on one problem: moving the expensive kernels of the WAVEWATCH III
  spectral wind-wave model to GPUs without changing the answer. The expensive routines
  (starting with the W3SNL1 nonlinear interaction source term) are ported to C++/Kokkos
  with coding agents under a bit-for-bit parity rule against the Fortran reference, on a
  Nix-pinned toolchain; the plans, decisions and measurements carry their evidence and the
  command that reproduces each number. The texts written from this work, a preprint and an
  undergraduate project proposal, have their Markdown sources in the repository.
